---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
import NavigationHub from '../components/NavigationHub.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="精準利基工具 | 驅動您的專業與被動收入" description="提供高品質、數據驅動的利基型網站工具，助您達成高效營運與 AdSense 被動收入目標。">
  <NavigationHub />
  
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto py-8 px-6">
    <header class="mb-16 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6 tracking-tight leading-tight">為您的利基市場打造，專業級數據工具</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">告別通用模板，擁抱專為特定需求設計的高效解決方案，極簡、強大、助您實現被動收入。</p>
      <a href="/tools" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 border border-transparent text-base font-medium rounded-full shadow-lg text-white bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:ring-opacity-50">
        探索我們的專業工具
        <svg class="ml-3 w-5 h-5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </header>
    </header>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16">
      <a href="/tools/dog-age-calculator" class="group block">
        <Card className="h-full hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:border-blue-500">
          <div class="text-blue-600 mb-4">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">狗狗年齡計算機</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">基於科學研究的犬隻生命階段分析，助您精準理解狗狗需求，提供最符合其年齡的照護建議。</p>
        </Card>
      </a>
      <a href="/tools/cat-age-calculator" class="group block">
        <Card className="h-full hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:border-blue-500">
          <div class="text-blue-600 mb-4">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">貓咪年齡計算機</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">透過專業演算法，精準換算貓咪的相對人類歲數，並提供各生命階段的關鍵照護重點與健康管理指南。</p>
        </Card>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- 部落格區塊 -->
    <section class="mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-8">最新部落格文章</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <a href="/blog/seo-checker-guide" class="group block">
          <Card className="h-full border-slate-200 hover:border-blue-500 transition-all">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">SEO 工具推薦</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">提升網站排名的必備利器，包含關鍵字研究、網站分析...</p>
          </Card>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog/ai-writing-assistant-guide" class="group block">
          <Card className="h-full border-slate-200 hover:border-blue-500 transition-all">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">AI 寫作助手指南</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">如何利用 AI 提升內容創作效率與質量，輕鬆掌握 SEO 內容。</p>
          </Card>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
